WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:31.791
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:31.791 --> 00:00:34.916
described His divine glories.

3
00:00:34.916 --> 00:00:38.125
Now in the third verse of the tenth chapter,

4
00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:39.166
Lord Krishna

5
00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:41.958
on the transformative power of understanding

6
00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:45.541
His true nature sheds light –

7
00:00:45.541 --> 00:00:49.791
that whoever truly knows Lord Krishna as He is,

8
00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:53.083
what change comes into their life.

9
00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:00.041
Lord Krishna declares

10
00:01:00.041 --> 00:01:04.333
that whoever knows Him as 'ajam' – the unborn,

11
00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:07.583
'anadi' – without any beginning,

12
00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:10.500
and 'sarva loka-maheshvaram' – the supreme

13
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.250
master of all worlds –

14
00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:16.083
such a person becomes free from illusion

15
00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:19.333
and is liberated from all sins.

16
00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:21.333
Let us, for a deeper

17
00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:23.250
understanding of these words,

18
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.875
understand them in detail.

19
00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:28.708
'Ajam' – the unborn.

20
00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:31.000
Lord Krishna is beyond the
cycle of birth and death

21
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.875
that binds ordinary beings.

22
00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:36.875
Although in this world

23
00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:40.333
He appears to take birth,
as the son of Vasudeva and

24
00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:42.000
Devaki

25
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.750
He appeared.

26
00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:45.750
But His birth is divine

27
00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.750
and not a product of material nature.

28
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:53.166
'Anadi' – meaning without any beginning.

29
00:01:53.166 --> 00:01:55.708
Lord Krishna has no origin.

30
00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:57.083
He is eternal

31
00:01:57.083 --> 00:02:00.833
and exists beyond the limits of time.

32
00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:03.291
While Brahma and other devas are sometimes

33
00:02:03.291 --> 00:02:06.500
called 'unborn,' because

34
00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:10.416
in the ordinary material sense,
they do not take birth,

35
00:02:10.416 --> 00:02:13.375
but they are not 'anadi.'

36
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:16.291
Their existence depends on Lord Krishna,

37
00:02:16.291 --> 00:02:19.416
who is the original cause of all causes.

38
00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:21.791
'Loka-maheshvaram' – meaning

39
00:02:21.791 --> 00:02:25.291
the supreme master of all worlds.

40
00:02:25.291 --> 00:02:26.333
Lord Krishna is not

41
00:02:26.333 --> 00:02:30.083
just one among many devas, but

42
00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:34.666
He is the supreme controller
and master of all the universes.

43
00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:37.458
He is different from devas like Brahma,

44
00:02:37.458 --> 00:02:40.125
who govern specific domains.

45
00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:43.250
Lord Krishna's sovereignty
extends to every aspect

46
00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:47.000
of creation – material and spiritual – both.

47
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:47.958
Lord Krishna's divine

48
00:02:47.958 --> 00:02:51.083
nature by understanding,
a person becomes 'asammudha,'

49
00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:54.166
meaning free from illusion.

50
00:02:54.166 --> 00:02:56.333
Illusion arises when we

51
00:02:56.333 --> 00:03:00.083
see Lord Krishna as an ordinary being

52
00:03:00.083 --> 00:03:01.583
or His divine activities

53
00:03:01.583 --> 00:03:03.666
as ordinary we consider.

54
00:03:03.666 --> 00:03:04.708
By knowing Lord Krishna

55
00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:06.416
as the eternal, beginningless

56
00:03:06.416 --> 00:03:08.416
source of all,

57
00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:10.250
this illusion is removed

58
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.375
and the heart is purified.

59
00:03:13.375 --> 00:03:15.500
Lord Krishna also says

60
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.208
that such understanding frees a person from

61
00:03:18.208 --> 00:03:21.375
'sarva-papaih' – meaning all sins.

62
00:03:21.375 --> 00:03:24.416
Sin is not just moral wrongdoing,

63
00:03:24.416 --> 00:03:27.583
but in it that ignorance and misdirected

64
00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:29.666
desires are also included,

65
00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:32.916
which keep us bound to the material world.

66
00:03:32.916 --> 00:03:35.666
By recognising Lord Krishna's supreme position,

67
00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:38.875
our desires align with His,

68
00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:40.208
and in this way the mind

69
00:03:40.208 --> 00:03:43.166
and heart are purified.

70
00:03:43.166 --> 00:03:44.125
This verse

71
00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:47.208
on Lord Krishna's earlier teachings is based,

72
00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:51.166
such as in the Bhagavad Gita's
fourth chapter, ninth verse,

73
00:03:51.166 --> 00:03:52.791
He has stated

74
00:03:52.791 --> 00:03:53.916
that of His birth

75
00:03:53.916 --> 00:03:55.041
and actions, the divine

76
00:03:55.041 --> 00:03:58.916
nature on knowing leads to liberation.

77
00:03:58.916 --> 00:04:00.500
He says again

78
00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.208
that by understanding His divine qualities,

79
00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:05.666
devotion is awakened and all karmic

80
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:09.166
reactions are destroyed,

81
00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:12.333
clearing the path to spiritual freedom.

82
00:04:12.333 --> 00:04:14.333
The way is cleared.

83
00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:15.625
In essence,

84
00:04:15.625 --> 00:04:18.458
Lord Krishna invites us

85
00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:19.666
to look beyond His

86
00:04:19.666 --> 00:04:22.583
direct human-like form

87
00:04:22.583 --> 00:04:25.500
and to understand
His true nature as the eternal, 

88
00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:30.333
all-powerful, and compassionate Lord.

89
00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:33.750
This realisation not only frees us from sin,

90
00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.583
but through devotion

91
00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:39.583
also deepens our relationship with Him.

92
00:04:44.375 --> 00:04:46.708
Do you for every

93
00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:50.750
outcome in life hold yourself responsible?

94
00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:54.041
Are you on your shoulders

95
00:04:54.041 --> 00:04:58.541
carrying the weight of the entire world?

96
00:04:58.541 --> 00:05:00.375
In life

97
00:05:00.375 --> 00:05:05.666
you believe that everything is in your hands.

98
00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:08.333
Just as a skilled driver

99
00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:09.416
to the vehicle

100
00:05:09.416 --> 00:05:13.708
gives the speed and direction he wishes,

101
00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:17.375
in the same way you too every action

102
00:05:17.375 --> 00:05:22.291
and decision’s results want to control.

103
00:05:22.291 --> 00:05:26.958
But I remind you –

104
00:05:26.958 --> 00:05:28.666
all beings

105
00:05:28.666 --> 00:05:31.625
and everything in them

106
00:05:31.625 --> 00:05:34.708
is under My care.

107
00:05:34.708 --> 00:05:38.333
Just as in space all the planets

108
00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:42.000
revolve in their orbits,

109
00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.375
yet by an unseen force are governed,

110
00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:50.083
in the same way the entire world

111
00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:53.416
is run by My laws.

112
00:05:53.416 --> 00:05:57.750
When you understand this truth,

113
00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.500
then of trying to control

114
00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:04.000
the uncontrollable, the heavy burden

115
00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:07.375
you are freed from.

116
00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:08.666
This understanding

117
00:06:08.666 --> 00:06:12.333
does not make you weak. Instead,

118
00:06:12.333 --> 00:06:13.583
in you the power

119
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:17.500
to make good decisions it increases.

120
00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.958
On what truly matters,

121
00:06:19.958 --> 00:06:23.000
you begin to focus your attention,

122
00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:27.166
like fulfilling your duty with sincerity

123
00:06:27.166 --> 00:06:31.041
and leaving the results to Me.

124
00:06:31.041 --> 00:06:32.750
When your actions

125
00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:36.250
are guided by this clarity,

126
00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.458
then sorrow gradually

127
00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:43.916
fades from your life.

128
00:06:43.916 --> 00:06:47.333
You find peace in knowing

129
00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:50.291
that you are not alone.

130
00:06:50.291 --> 00:06:52.833
The weight of the world

131
00:06:52.833 --> 00:06:57.916
is not on your shoulders.

132
00:06:57.916 --> 00:07:00.333
Trust Me,

133
00:07:00.333 --> 00:07:03.625
act wisely,

134
00:07:03.625 --> 00:07:06.250
and illusion

135
00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.083
let it go.

136
00:07:11.916 --> 00:07:13.916
Think about this - 

137
00:07:13.916 --> 00:07:18.083
in family and society, most conflicts

138
00:07:18.083 --> 00:07:22.958
and divisions arise from ignorance.

139
00:07:22.958 --> 00:07:25.875
In a family, misunderstandings

140
00:07:25.875 --> 00:07:29.458
or wrong decisions often happen

141
00:07:29.458 --> 00:07:33.208
when someone lacks proper knowledge

142
00:07:33.208 --> 00:07:36.666
or falls into confusion.

143
00:07:36.666 --> 00:07:40.125
This can be due to limited
experience, wrong advice,

144
00:07:40.125 --> 00:07:45.000
or because of an unsettled mind.

145
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.541
When you see a loved one

146
00:07:47.541 --> 00:07:50.375
caught in a problem,

147
00:07:50.375 --> 00:07:53.250
then the best way to help

148
00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:56.125
is not just to point out their mistake,

149
00:07:56.125 --> 00:07:57.416
but to guide them

150
00:07:57.416 --> 00:08:01.500
toward deeper truths

151
00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.375
that can change their perspective.

152
00:08:04.375 --> 00:08:06.750
Just as I

153
00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.625
do not just resolve Arjun's immediate

154
00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:14.583
doubts, but also give him about life

155
00:08:14.583 --> 00:08:19.875
and about Me the supreme truth of knowledge.

156
00:08:19.875 --> 00:08:21.125
You too

157
00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:22.791
with your family

158
00:08:22.791 --> 00:08:26.208
can communicate in the same way.

159
00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:28.250
See,

160
00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:31.666
in a family when parents

161
00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:33.041
only their children

162
00:08:33.041 --> 00:08:36.958
for their failure scold them,

163
00:08:36.958 --> 00:08:37.916
then the child

164
00:08:37.916 --> 00:08:40.458
may only make a temporary correction.

165
00:08:40.458 --> 00:08:42.166
But

166
00:08:42.166 --> 00:08:43.291
when they

167
00:08:43.291 --> 00:08:46.833
give the child the knowledge of life's values,

168
00:08:46.833 --> 00:08:48.375
then the child himself

169
00:08:48.375 --> 00:08:51.416
learns to make the right decisions,

170
00:08:51.416 --> 00:08:55.083
and recognising the cause of his failures

171
00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:58.875
does not repeat the mistakes again.

172
00:08:58.875 --> 00:09:02.666
Instead of criticising their actions,

173
00:09:02.666 --> 00:09:07.916
with a greater purpose help them connect.

174
00:09:07.916 --> 00:09:10.375
Integrity, responsibility,

175
00:09:10.375 --> 00:09:15.375
and love for a higher purpose – such values –

176
00:09:15.375 --> 00:09:17.625
these are the foundations

177
00:09:17.625 --> 00:09:19.250
that guide decisions

178
00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.958
in the right direction.

179
00:09:21.958 --> 00:09:25.208
When you provide not just correction,

180
00:09:25.208 --> 00:09:28.416
but knowledge too,

181
00:09:28.416 --> 00:09:33.041
then you sow the seeds of lasting change.

182
00:09:33.041 --> 00:09:36.958
Through patience and love,

183
00:09:36.958 --> 00:09:40.250
into your family clarity

184
00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:44.791
and harmony you can bring.

185
00:09:44.791 --> 00:09:48.416
By knowing My true nature,

186
00:09:48.416 --> 00:09:51.541
you yourself will become pure.

187
00:09:51.541 --> 00:09:55.750
Through you, the family will be purified.

188
00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:59.875
Through you, society will be purified.

189
00:09:59.875 --> 00:10:02.083
This is the beauty

190
00:10:02.083 --> 00:10:03.541
of realisation.

191
00:10:08.291 --> 00:10:10.958
In the professional environment,

192
00:10:10.958 --> 00:10:13.916
mistakes or oversights

193
00:10:13.916 --> 00:10:15.833
often happen

194
00:10:15.833 --> 00:10:19.375
when people lack clarity

195
00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:22.916
or fall into confusion.

196
00:10:22.916 --> 00:10:26.916
As a leader, it is easy to point out

197
00:10:26.916 --> 00:10:30.541
what went wrong, but

198
00:10:30.541 --> 00:10:35.125
to truly uplift your colleagues,

199
00:10:35.125 --> 00:10:38.125
you must help them see things

200
00:10:38.125 --> 00:10:39.958
from a broader perspective.

201
00:10:39.958 --> 00:10:43.083
What goal are they working toward,

202
00:10:43.083 --> 00:10:46.500
and why does it matter?

203
00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:49.791
Just as I, for Arjun,

204
00:10:49.791 --> 00:10:52.166
about life and My role in it

205
00:10:52.166 --> 00:10:54.333
the supreme truth, revealing it,

206
00:10:54.333 --> 00:10:57.250
guide him,

207
00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:59.083
in the same way you too

208
00:10:59.083 --> 00:11:03.708
your team's daily tasks to the organisation's

209
00:11:03.708 --> 00:11:06.250
larger vision connect them

210
00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:08.000
and inspire them.

211
00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:11.125
Instead of just pointing out mistakes,

212
00:11:11.125 --> 00:11:13.583
those values and goals

213
00:11:13.583 --> 00:11:16.583
take the time to share

214
00:11:16.583 --> 00:11:21.125
which form the foundation of your work.

215
00:11:21.125 --> 00:11:22.666
True leadership

216
00:11:22.666 --> 00:11:26.708
is not just about fixing problems.

217
00:11:26.708 --> 00:11:30.208
It is about fostering purpose

218
00:11:30.208 --> 00:11:32.333
and clarity,

219
00:11:32.333 --> 00:11:34.708
which changes how your team

220
00:11:34.708 --> 00:11:38.500
faces and handles challenges.
